<title>SYRIA: syria cancels tender for 26,000 tonnes sugar.</title>
<headline>syria cancels tender for 26,000 tonnes sugar.</headline>
<text>
<p>DAMASCUS, June 18 - Syria has cancelled tenders to buy 13,000 tonnes of raw sugar and 13,000 tonnes of white sugar, a General Foreign Trade Organisation for Chemicals and Foodstuffs (GEZA) official said.</p>
<p>The sugar was for July and August delivery.</p>
